files <- list.files()
newfilenames <- gsub('.nc', replacement = '_time.nc <http://time.nc>', x = files)
file.rename(files, newfilenames)

Note that I haven’t installed NCO yet so I did not modify the .nc files.

When I run micro_ncep(), I get this error message:
extracting weather data locally from R/Spatial_Data_NCEP
